                "    {\"S001\", \"Refunds and returns\", \"I received a pair of wireless headphones 12 days ago and changed my mind. Can I return it for a refund?\", \"Yes. Unused items in original packaging can be returned within 30 days of delivery, so it is still eligible. Print the prepaid return label from your order page; the $6.99 label cost is deducted from the refund. Once the warehouse receives the item, the refund goes back to your original payment method within 5 to 7 business days.\", \"Thanks for reaching out. Yes. Unused items in original packaging can be returned within 30 days of delivery, so it is still eligible. Print the prepaid return label from your order page; the $6.99 label cost is deducted from the refund. Once the warehouse receives the item, the refund goes back to your original payment method within 5 to 7 business days.\", \"Happy to help with that. Yes. Unused items in original packaging can be returned within 14 days of delivery, so it is still eligible. Print the prepaid return label from your order page; the $6.99 label cost is deducted from the refund. Once the warehouse receives the item, the refund goes back to your original payment method within 5 to 7 business days.\", \"Pass\", \"Fail\", \"\", \"Wrong policy fact\", \"\", \"Contains prohibited claim: \"\"within 14 days of delivery\"\".\", \"Regressed\"},",
