                "    {\"S004\", \"Refunds and returns\", \"I received a pair of running shoes 4 days ago and changed my mind. Can I return it for a refund?\", \"Yes. Unused items in original packaging can be returned within 30 days of delivery, so it is still eligible. Print the prepaid return label from your order page; the $6.99 label cost is deducted from the refund. Once the warehouse receives the item, the refund goes back to your original payment method within 5 to 7 business days.\", \"Thanks for reaching out. Yes. Unused items in original packaging can be returned within 30 days of delivery, so it is still eligible. Print the prepaid return label from your order page; the $6.99 label cost is deducted from the refund. Once the warehouse receives the item, the refund goes back to your original payment method within 5 to 7 business days.\", \"Happy to help with that. Yes. Unused items in original packaging can be returned within 30 days of delivery, so it is still eligible. Print the prepaid return label from your order page; the $6.99 label cost is deducted from the refund. Once the warehouse receives the item, the refund goes back to your original payment method within 5 to 7 business days.\", \"Pass\", \"Pass\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"Both pass\"},",
                "    {\"S005\", \"Refunds and returns\", \"I received a coffee grinder 27 days ago and changed my mind. Can I return it for a refund?\", \"Yes. Unused items in original packaging can be returned within 30 days of delivery, so it is still eligible. Print the prepaid return label from your order page; the $6.99 label cost is deducted from the refund. Once the warehouse receives the item, the refund goes back to your original payment method within 5 to 7 business days.\", \"Thanks for reaching out. Yes. Unused items in original packaging can be returned within 30 days of delivery, so it is still eligible. Print the prepaid return label from your order page; the $6.99 label cost is deducted from the refund. Once the warehouse receives the item, the refund goes back to your original payment method within 5 to 7 business days.\", \"Happy to help with that. Yes. Unused items in original packaging can be returned within 30 days of delivery, so it is still eligible. Print the prepaid return label from your order page; the $6.99 label cost is deducted from the refund. Once the warehouse receives the item, the refund goes back to your original payment method within 5 to 7 business days.\", \"Pass\", \"Pass\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"Both pass\"},",
                "    {\"S006\", \"Refunds and returns\", \"My robot vacuum stopped charging after two weeks. I bought it about six weeks ago. What are my options?\", \"I'm sorry about that. Defective items are covered for 90 days from delivery, so you are well within the window. You can choose a replacement or a full refund. Return shipping is free for defective items; we email a prepaid label and the refund or replacement is processed when the item is scanned by the carrier.\", \"Thanks for reaching out. I'm sorry about that. Defective items are covered for 30 days from delivery, so unfortunately this is outside the return window. You can choose a replacement or a full refund. Return shipping is free for defective items; we email a prepaid label and the refund or replacement is processed when the item is scanned by the carrier.\", \"Happy to help with that. I'm sorry about that. Defective items are covered for 90 days from delivery, so you are well within the window. You can choose a replacement or a full refund. Return shipping is free for defective items; we email a prepaid label and the refund or replacement is processed when the item is scanned by the carrier.\", \"Fail\", \"Pass\", \"Wrong policy fact\", \"\", \"Contains prohibited claim: \"\"30 days from delivery\"\".\", \"\", \"Improved\"},",
                "    {\"S007\", \"Refunds and returns\", \"My blender arrived with a cracked jar. I bought it about six weeks ago. What are my options?\", \"I'm sorry about that. Defective items are covered for 90 days from delivery, so you are well within the window. You can choose a replacement or a full refund. Return shipping is free for defective items; we email a prepaid label and the refund or replacement is processed when the item is scanned by the carrier.\", \"Thanks for reaching out. I'm sorry about that. Defective items are covered for 90 days from delivery, so you are well within the window. You can choose a replacement or a full refund. Return shipping is free for defective items; we email a prepaid label and the refund or replacement is processed when the item is scanned by the carrier.\", \"Happy to help with that. I'm sorry about that. Defective items are covered for 30 days from delivery, so unfortunately this is outside the return window. You can choose a replacement or a full refund. Return shipping is free for defective items; we email a prepaid label and the refund or replacement is processed when the item is scanned by the carrier.\", \"Pass\", \"Fail\", \"\", \"Wrong policy fact\", \"\", \"Contains prohibited claim: \"\"30 days from delivery\"\".\", \"Regressed\"},",
                "    {\"S008\", \"Refunds and returns\", \"My electric kettle leaks from the base. I bought it about six weeks ago. What are my options?\", \"I'm sorry about that. Defective items are covered for 90 days from delivery, so you are well within the window. You can choose a replacement or a full refund. Return shipping is free for defective items; we email a prepaid label and the refund or replacement is processed when the item is scanned by the carrier.\", \"Thanks for reaching out. I'm sorry about that. Defective items are covered for 90 days from delivery, so you are well within the window. Return shipping is free for defective items; we email a prepaid label and the refund or replacement is processed when the item is scanned by the carrier.\", \"Happy to help with that. I'm sorry about that. Defective items are covered for 90 days from delivery, so you are well within the window. You can choose a replacement or a full refund. Return shipping is free for defective items; we email a prepaid label and the refund or replacement is processed when the item is scanned by the carrier.\", \"Fail\", \"Pass\", \"Incomplete answer\", \"\", \"Missing required element: \"\"replacement or a full refund\"\".\", \"\", \"Improved\"},",
                "    {\"S009\", \"Refunds and returns\", \"I want to return the clearance winter jacket I bought last week. It was marked final sale but it doesn't suit me.\", \"Final-sale items cannot be returned or refunded unless they arrive damaged or defective. If the item is faulty, reply with a photo and we will arrange a free replacement or refund.\", \"Thanks for reaching out. Final-sale items cannot be returned or refunded unless they arrive damaged or defective. If the item is faulty, reply with a photo and we will arrange a free replacement or refund.\", \"Happy to help with that. Since it was only last week, we can process a refund once the item is back at the warehouse. If the item is faulty, reply with a photo and we will arrange a free replacement or refund.\", \"Pass\", \"Fail\", \"\", \"Unsupported promise\", \"\", \"Contains prohibited claim: \"\"we can process a refund\"\".\", \"Regressed\"},",
                "    {\"S010\", \"Refunds and returns\", \"I want to return the open-box tablet I bought last week. It was marked final sale but it doesn't suit me.\", \"Final-sale items cannot be returned or refunded unless they arrive damaged or defective. If the item is faulty, reply with a photo and we will arrange a free replacement or refund.\", \"Thanks for reaching out. Final-sale items cannot be returned or refunded unless they arrive damaged or defective. If the item is faulty, reply with a photo and we will arrange a free replacement or refund.\", \"Happy to help with that. Final-sale items cannot be returned or refunded unless they arrive damaged or defective.\", \"Pass\", \"Fail\", \"\", \"Incomplete answer\", \"\", \"Missing required element: \"\"faulty\"\".\", \"Regressed\"},",
                "    {\"S011\", \"Refunds and returns\", \"I downloaded the photo-editing software bundle 20 days ago and never activated it. Can I get a refund?\", \"Software and digital downloads are refundable within 14 days of purchase if the license has not been activated. At 20 days this purchase is outside that window, so a refund is not available. If the download will not install, our support team can troubleshoot it with you.\", \"Thanks for reaching out. Software and digital downloads are refundable within 14 days of purchase if the license has not been activated. At 20 days this purchase is outside that window, so a refund is not available. If the download will not install, our support team can troubleshoot it with you.\", \"Happy to help with that. Software and digital downloads are refundable within 30 days of purchase if the license has not been activated. At 20 days this purchase is outside that window, so a refund is not available. If the download will not install, our support team can troubleshoot it with you.\", \"Pass\", \"Fail\", \"\", \"Wrong policy fact\", \"\", \"Contains prohibited claim: \"\"within 30 days of purchase\"\".\", \"Regressed\"},",
                "    {\"S012\", \"Shipping and delivery\", \"How much is shipping on a $34 order and how long does standard delivery take?\", \"A $34 order has a $6.99 standard shipping charge because it is under $50. Standard delivery takes 5 to 7 business days from the day the order ships. Expedited delivery is available for $14.99 and arrives in 2 business days.\", \"Thanks for reaching out. A $34 order has a $6.99 standard shipping charge because it is under $50. Standard delivery takes 5 to 7 business days from the day the order ships. Expedited delivery is available for $14.99 and arrives in 2 business days.\", \"Happy to help with that. A $34 order has a $6.99 standard shipping charge because it is under $50. Standard delivery takes 5 to 7 business days from the day the order ships. Expedited delivery is available for $14.99 and arrives in 2 business days.\", \"Pass\", \"Pass\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"Both pass\"},",
                "    {\"S013\", \"Shipping and delivery\", \"How much is shipping on a $48 order and how long does standard delivery take?\", \"A $48 order has a $6.99 standard shipping charge because it is under $50. Standard delivery takes 5 to 7 business days from the day the order ships. Expedited delivery is available for $14.99 and arrives in 2 business days.\", \"Thanks for reaching out. A $48 order ships free because it is over $50. Standard delivery takes 5 to 7 business days from the day the order ships. Expedited delivery is available for $14.99 and arrives in 2 business days.\", \"Happy to help with that. A $48 order has a $6.99 standard shipping charge because it is under $50. Standard delivery takes 5 to 7 business days from the day the order ships. Expedited delivery is available for $14.99 and arrives in 2 business days.\", \"Fail\", \"Pass\", \"Wrong policy fact\", \"\", \"Contains prohibited claim: \"\"ships free\"\".\", \"\", \"Improved\"},",
