                "    {\"S015\", \"Shipping and delivery\", \"How much is shipping on a $120 order and how long does standard delivery take?\", \"A $120 order ships free because it is over $50. Standard delivery takes 5 to 7 business days from the day the order ships. Expedited delivery is available for $14.99 and arrives in 2 business days.\", \"Thanks for reaching out. A $120 order ships free because it is over $50. Standard delivery takes 5 to 7 business days from the day the order ships. Expedited delivery is available for $14.99 and arrives in 2 business days.\", \"Happy to help with that. A $120 order ships free because it is over $50. Standard delivery takes 5 to 7 business days from the day the order ships. Expedited delivery is available for $14.99 and arrives in 2 business days.\", \"Pass\", \"Pass\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"Both pass\"},",
                "    {\"S016\", \"Shipping and delivery\", \"My order LG-48211 was supposed to arrive 3 days ago and tracking has not moved. What happens now?\", \"Order LG-48211 is 3 days past its estimated delivery date. We can open a lost-package claim once a package is 7 days past the estimate. Please check with neighbors and your building's mail room, and reply if it has not arrived by then; we will reship or refund at that point.\", \"Thanks for reaching out. Order LG-48211 is 3 days past its estimated delivery date. We can open a lost-package claim once a package is 7 days past the estimate. Please check with neighbors and your building's mail room, and reply if it has not arrived by then; we will reship or refund at that point.\", \"Happy to help with that. Order LG-48211 is 3 days past its estimated delivery date. We can open a lost-package claim once a package is 7 days past the estimate. Please check with neighbors and your building's mail room, and reply if it has not arrived by then; we will reship or refund at that point.\", \"Pass\", \"Pass\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"Both pass\"},",
                "    {\"S017\", \"Shipping and delivery\", \"My order LG-48377 was supposed to arrive 9 days ago and tracking has not moved. What happens now?\", \"Order LG-48377 is 9 days past its estimated delivery date, which is beyond the 7 days past the estimate we wait before treating a package as lost. I have opened a lost-package claim; you can choose a free reshipment or a full refund. Reshipments go out within 1 business day and refunds post in 5 to 7 business days.\", \"Thanks for reaching out. Order LG-48377 is 9 days past its estimated delivery date, which is beyond the 7 days past the estimate we wait before treating a package as lost. I have opened a lost-package claim; you can choose a free reshipment or a full refund. Reshipments go out within 1 business day and refunds post in 5 to 7 business days.\", \"Happy to help with that. Order LG-48377 is 9 days past its estimated delivery date, which is beyond the 7 days past the estimate we wait before treating a package as lost. I have opened a lost-package claim; you can choose a free reshipment or a full refund. Reshipments go out within 1 business day and refunds post in 5 to 7 business days.\", \"Pass\", \"Pass\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"Both pass\"},",
                "    {\"S018\", \"Shipping and delivery\", \"My order LG-48402 was supposed to arrive 12 days ago and tracking has not moved. What happens now?\", \"Order LG-48402 is 12 days past its estimated delivery date, which is beyond the 7 days past the estimate we wait before treating a package as lost. I have opened a lost-package claim; you can choose a free reshipment or a full refund. Reshipments go out within 1 business day and refunds post in 5 to 7 business days.\", \"Thanks for reaching out. Order LG-48402 is 12 days past its estimated delivery date, which is beyond the 7 days past the estimate we wait before treating a package as lost. Reshipments go out within 1 business day and refunds post in 5 to 7 business days.\", \"Happy to help with that. Order LG-48402 is 12 days past its estimated delivery date, which is beyond the 7 days past the estimate we wait before treating a package as lost. Reshipments go out within 1 business day and refunds post in 5 to 7 business days.\", \"Fail\", \"Fail\", \"Incomplete answer\", \"Incomplete answer\", \"Missing required element: \"\"reshipment or a full refund\"\".\", \"Missing required element: \"\"reshipment or a full refund\"\".\", \"Both fail\"},",
                "    {\"S019\", \"Shipping and delivery\", \"I entered the wrong apartment number. My order shows Processing. Can you fix the address?\", \"Yes. The address can be changed while an order is still in Processing, before it ships. Reply with the corrected address and I will update it; you will get a confirmation email. Once the status changes to Shipped the carrier controls delivery and we cannot edit the address.\", \"Thanks for reaching out. Yes. The address can be changed while an order is still in Processing, before it ships. Once the status changes to Shipped the carrier controls delivery and we cannot edit the address.\", \"Happy to help with that. Yes. The address can be changed while an order is still in Processing, before it ships. Reply with the corrected address and I will update it; you will get a confirmation email. Once the status changes to Shipped the carrier controls delivery and we cannot edit the address.\", \"Fail\", \"Pass\", \"Incomplete answer\", \"\", \"Missing required element: \"\"corrected address\"\".\", \"\", \"Improved\"},",
                "    {\"S020\", \"Shipping and delivery\", \"My order already says Shipped but I need it sent to my office instead. Can you redirect it?\", \"Once an order is marked Shipped we cannot edit the address on our side. You can request a redirect or hold-at-location directly through the carrier's tracking page using your tracking number. If the package comes back to us undeliverable, we will refund it in full.\", \"Thanks for reaching out. Once an order is marked Shipped we cannot edit the address on our side. You can request a redirect or hold-at-location directly through the carrier's tracking page using your tracking number. If the package comes back to us undeliverable, we will refund it in full.\", \"Happy to help with that. Once an order is marked Shipped we cannot edit the address on our side. You can request a redirect or hold-at-location directly through the carrier's tracking page using your tracking number. If the package comes back to us undeliverable, we will refund it in full.\", \"Pass\", \"Pass\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"Both pass\"},",
                "    {\"S021\", \"Shipping and delivery\", \"Do you ship to Canada? I have a US account.\", \"We currently ship only to addresses in the United States, including Alaska, Hawaii, and APO/FPO addresses. A US freight-forwarding address will work, but we cannot support customs or duties on the forwarded leg.\", \"Thanks for reaching out. We currently ship only to addresses in the United States, including Alaska, Hawaii, and APO/FPO addresses. A US freight-forwarding address will work, but we cannot support customs or duties on the forwarded leg.\", \"Happy to help with that. Yes, we ship to Canada for a flat $19.99 fee. A US freight-forwarding address will work, but we cannot support customs or duties on the forwarded leg.\", \"Pass\", \"Fail\", \"\", \"Unsupported promise\", \"\", \"Contains prohibited claim: \"\"ship to Canada\"\".\", \"Regressed\"},",
                "    {\"S022\", \"Shipping and delivery\", \"Can I upgrade to expedited shipping after I already placed my order an hour ago?\", \"Yes, as long as the order is still in Processing you can upgrade to expedited delivery for $14.99. Expedited orders arrive in 2 business days after they ship. Reply with a yes and I will apply the upgrade and charge the difference to your card on file.\", \"Thanks for reaching out. Yes, as long as the order is still in Processing you can upgrade to expedited delivery for $14.99. Reply with a yes and I will apply the upgrade and charge the difference to your card on file.\", \"Happy to help with that. Yes, as long as the order is still in Processing you can upgrade to expedited delivery for $14.99. Expedited orders arrive in 2 business days after they ship. Reply with a yes and I will apply the upgrade and charge the difference to your card on file.\", \"Fail\", \"Pass\", \"Wrong policy fact\", \"\", \"Missing required element: \"\"2 business days\"\".\", \"\", \"Improved\"},",
                "    {\"S023\", \"Billing and payments\", \"I was charged $84.20 twice for order LG-47910. Can you refund the duplicate?\", \"I can see two charges of $84.20 on order LG-47910; one is a duplicate. Duplicate charges are reversed within 3 to 5 business days after our billing review, which I have started. If the second charge is still showing as pending, it may be an authorization hold that drops off on its own within 3 business days.\", \"Thanks for reaching out. I can see two charges of $84.20 on order LG-47910; one is a duplicate. Duplicate charges are reversed within 3 to 5 business days after our billing review, which I have started. If the second charge is still showing as pending, it may be an authorization hold that drops off on its own within 3 business days.\", \"Happy to help with that. I can see two charges of $84.20 on order LG-47910; one is a duplicate. Duplicate charges are reversed within 3 to 5 business days after our billing review, which I have started. If the second charge is still showing as pending, it may be an authorization hold that drops off on its own within 3 business days.\", \"Pass\", \"Pass\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"Both pass\"},",
